{"id":"n3-060","title":"～といっても","romaji":"〜to ittemo","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express the meaning 'even though', 'although', 'but'.","longExplanation":"The ～といっても grammar point is used to show a contrast or clarify that 'even though' something is the case, it does not necessarily lead to the expected result. It can be translated as 'even though', 'although', or 'but'.","formation":"Verb-casual + といっても, い-Adjective + といっても, な-Adjective + だといっても, Noun + だといっても","examples":[{"jp":"彼は有名だといっても、みんなに知られているわけではありません。","romaji":"Kare wa yuumei da to ittemo, minna ni shirarete iru wake de wa arimasen.","en":"Even though he's famous, it doesn't mean everyone knows him.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"有名","vocabId":"1541620","reading":"ゆうめい"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みんな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"知ら","vocabId":"1420470","reading":"しる","baseForm":"知る"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"わけ","vocabId":"1538330","reading":"わけ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"このスープは辛いといっても、私にはちょうどいいです。","romaji":"Kono suupu wa karai to ittemo, watashi ni wa choudo ii desu.","en":"Although this soup is spicy, it's just right for me.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"スープ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"辛い","vocabId":"1365860","reading":"つらい"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いっ",